# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Large data and intermediates
#
# Raw inputs, ESM-2 embedding matrices, model weights and per-family
# prediction matrices are not versioned: the protein-family inputs alone
# exceed 2.5 GB. Every source is public and documented in the README, so
# the pipeline can be re-run from scratch. Small result tables (CSV) and
# all generated figures are versioned.
